      "derivationNotes": "Same single-entry detail layout as RecordDetail. Header shows visit date + provider name + clinic location instead of record title. Sections: Visit Summary (chief complaint, assessment, plan), Vitals Captured (BP, HR, Temp, Weight in clinical font), Diagnoses (condition list with ICD codes as small badges), Medications Prescribed (medication cards), Orders Placed (lab/imaging/referrals), Follow-up (next appointment date + tasks). Right rail: Provider info card, Attachments list, Related Records. Permission badges + encryption indicators preserved."
