      "type": "derive_from",
      "designFile": null,
      "deriveFrom": "design-health-records-sharing.html",
      "derivationNotes": "Same Meridian shell + sidebar nav + Sharing-style headline area. Body becomes a centered form card (max-width 720px) titled 'Invite someone to your records'. Fields: Recipient role (segmented control: Provider / Caregiver / Read-only viewer), Recipient name, Email, Phone (optional), Permission scope (multi-select chips: Records, Medications, Labs, Documents, Visits, Immunizations), Date range (start/end with 'No expiration' toggle), Personal message (textarea). Right rail or footer shows live preview of the permission badge that will be issued. Footer actions: Cancel + 'Send invitation' (primary). Encryption note pinned at bottom."
